requirements:
任职要求:
1、精通Mysql数据库的运行机制和体系架构优先,有3年企业云的应用运维工作经验;
2、精通linux系统,熟悉Docker等容器技术,能独立解决突发和疑难问题;
3、对常用互联网公司的技术熟练部署, 配置 优化,包括不局限于elb,redis,jenkins,kafka,mysql,等技术有大规模应用经验;
4、有过大并发部署经验,可以独立设计云架构方案,云部署,熟悉安全策略,网站配置等;
5、对运维的监控保障有清晰的规划,设定报警级别,监控手段,报警策略等;
6、同研发共同保证系统业务安全稳定性。
7、较好的沟通和英语表达能力,善于团队合作。

job_description:
TVBS開發團隊對於軟體的品質有最高的要求。我們致力於以穩定的開發速率，持續地交付有價值的軟體來滿足客戶需求，並以全局為考量穩定改善團隊及消除多餘的浪費。我們深信最佳的架構與設計來自於能自我組織的團隊，歡迎有相同信念的朋友一起加入！本職位為負責建立創新產品(App為主) 的產品經理，致力建立有別於傳統媒體的產品;
Job Description:
能夠將商業或產品模型概念轉化成相對應的用戶流程協同 設計師 及 工程師 產出相應的設計 及 開發需求文件負責規劃新產品的至少未來一年的路線圖協助日常專案管理中的溝通協助，及追蹤專案進度

We are a team to design, develop, maintain, and improve software for various ventures projects, i.e., projects that are adjacent to our core businesses and are bootstrapped fast with a lean team. You will be actively involved in the design of various components behind scalable applications, from frontend UI to backend infrastructure.
As a Senior Backend Developer, you will design, develop, maintain, and improve software for various new ventures projects, i.e., projects that are adjacent to our core businesses and are bootstrapped fast with a lean team. You will be actively involved in the design and development of backend components for scalable applications, focusing on server-side logic, cache/database management, and API integration.Responsibilities
-Development activities include backend development, proposing architectural decisions, participating in designs, design review, code review and implementation of products bridging Crypto.com to developers and end-users;
Develop prototypes for new ideas proposed by you and the team;
You are the owner of your projects. We are open-minded to new technologies and you can try-out different things here;
Identify issues and implement solutions to complex problems in large-scale backend infrastructure and mobile platforms; -
Management of documentation of all code and functionalities implemented;
Work closely with DevOps and mobile engineers to improve tech stack for long-term engineering initiatives.
